{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"518e9061-ed9f-42d1-ae44-cf5200aee6c8":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/star-rating\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"fd35310f-a903-4f2a-aa78-92f345583144":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.link_to_title.value }}"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"only_tier_gang_button":"Required gang tier not reached","set_size":3,"set_text":"Wähle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":""}},"wishlist_engine_product_page_D8WxNQ":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/se-wishlist-engine\/blocks\/Product-Page\/8f7c0857-8e71-463d-a168-8e133094753b","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"97ce63d9-5477-4fed-a92a-335ffa45b484":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/klarna-on-site-messaging\/blocks\/app-block\/b95936a9-74b6-4a95-8103-6a1b6459c25e","settings":{"data_key":"credit-promotion-badge","theme":"light","topPadding":"0","bottomPadding":"0","messagePrefix":""}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p>Tough Nut is our unique and bestselling hazelnut liquor, crafted from authentic high-proof Moonshine spirit infused with rich <strong>hazelnut<\/strong>, smooth caramel and velvety nougat, and all finished off with a dash of barrel-aged whiskey.<\/p><p>Perfect for a variety of <strong>recipes and cocktails,<\/strong> our Tough Nut is great to enjoy neat over ice but also puts the perfect Moonshine twist on a whole host of classic drinks, including a 'White Russian' or ‘Espresso Martini’. <\/p><p>Head over to our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\/tagged\/tough-nut\"><strong>Tou<\/strong><\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\/tagged\/tough-nut\" title=\"Tough Nut Cocktail\"><strong>gh Nut cocktails recipes<\/strong><\/a> for more inspiration.<\/p><p>Bottled in traditional Mason Jars, we promise a unique drinking experience. If you would like to discover <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">more high quality liqueurs, <\/a> have a look at our entire product range and become part of our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\">Moonshine Gang<\/a> to collect proof points and get unique benefits.<\/p><p>Curious? Simply order your Tough Nut liqueur online today and we'll ship it to anywhere within mainland UK within a few working days.<\/p><p><strong>Please note: All of our products are shipped in branded boxes.<\/strong><\/p>","page":""}},"08a702ee-31b7-4e82-b9f9-90592e4d2eff":{"type":"collapsible_tab","disabled":true,"settings":{"heading":"Moonshine Must-Haves","icon":"check_mark","content":"<p>1. Your jar of <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">Moonshine<\/a>.<\/p><p>2. Our reusable <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/pouring-lid\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/pouring-lid\">Pouring Lid<\/a> to not waste a drop.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<p><strong>Tough Nut Neat<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>50ml Tough Nut<\/li><li>Ice Cubes<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p>Add ice to your glass, then fill with a generous measure of Tough Nut Moonshine. <\/p><p>You can find more recipes on our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\">cocktail blog<\/a>.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"29562b2d-d73d-4a10-83aa-0c0922c0fbca":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products, unless stated otherwise, are suitable for vegans and those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}},"recommended_products_CnfPA6":{"type":"recommended_products","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"The Perfect Gifting","content":"","button_text":"","product_list":["macadamia","giftbox"],"enable_bulk_add":false,"columns_desktop":"2","enable_desktop_slider":true,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":true}}},"block_order":["title","caption","518e9061-ed9f-42d1-ae44-cf5200aee6c8","price","description","variant_picker","fd35310f-a903-4f2a-aa78-92f345583144","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","wishlist_engine_product_page_D8WxNQ","97ce63d9-5477-4fed-a92a-335ffa45b484","collapsible-row-